				"title": {
					"en": "Dunhuang mineral pigment, not a faceted mascot",
					"zh": "\u6566\u714c\u77ff\u7269\u989c\u6599\uff0c\u800c\u975e\u5207\u9762\u5409\u7965\u7269"
				},
				"description": {
					"en": "Azurite crest, malachite cheek band, cinnabar ribbon and gold-leaf flecks inside fine dark ink outlines, with pigment granulation and weathered flecks. The animal-family flat polygon facets were explicitly withdrawn for this project.",
					"zh": "\u77f3\u9752\u51a0\u80cc\u3001\u77f3\u7eff\u988a\u5e26\u3001\u4e39\u7802\u98d8\u5e26\u4e0e\u91d1\u7b94\u6591\u70b9\uff0c\u4ee5\u7ec6\u58a8\u7ebf\u52fe\u52d2\uff0c\u5e26\u989c\u6599\u9897\u7c92\u4e0e\u5265\u843d\u611f\u3002\u9879\u76ee\u660e\u786e\u653e\u5f03\u5bb6\u65cf\u5e73\u9762\u5207\u9762\u753b\u6cd5\u3002"
				}
			},
			{
				"aspect": "presentation",
				"title": {
					"en": "Weathered plaster light",
					"zh": "\u6591\u9a73\u7802\u58c1\u5149"
				},
				"description": {
					"en": "A sand plaster field with hairline drying cracks, a lifting plaster edge and three pigment flecks, plus paper grain and one soft contact shadow. It follows the site's sand-and-mineral surface rather than a generic icon tile.",
